#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ទេថា អ្នក​អាច​រក្សា​តំបន់​​មិន​ឲ្យ​មាន​តំណត់​ទឹកភ្លៀង​ជា​មួយ​នឹង\n"
"ឧបករណ៍ '​ជ្រើស' ? ដោយ​ជ្រើស​ផ្ទៃដើម្បី​ជៀសវាង (ឧទាហរណ៍ ផ្ទៃ​មុខ) មុន​ពេល\n"
"ចាប់ផ្ដើម​តម្រង 'តំណក់ទឹកភ្លៀង' នឹង​រក្សាទុក​វា​​មិន​ឲ្យ​មាន​តំណក់​ទឹកភ្លៀង ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ទេ​ថា អ្នក​អាច​ក្លែង​ភាព​គ្រាប់​​នៃ​រូបថត​ពណ៌​សខ្មៅ​ជា​មួយ​នឹងកម្មវិធី​ជំនួយ​កម្មវិធី​និពន្ធ​របស់របស់ 'គ្រាប់​ហ្វីល' ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

